   "source": [
    "# RDKit workshop\n",
    "\n",
    "In the following, RDKit will be applied to explore a chemical dataset (Delaney) on the solubility of various substances in water (logS(mol/L))."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "0fe133bb",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
